# Private modules (never committed; local-only closed-source additions)
# 2026-10-23 起这里只剩打印、小程序、生成物内 AI 和它们的测试；
# 复杂页（UiComposition）已开源，是仓库根目录下的独立项目。
/CodeMaster.Private/
CodeMaster.Private.sln

# Private front end: the print designer.
# Its back end is a module under CodeMaster.Private/, so the UI goes with it.
