# Mini-app template (closed-source selling point).
# The generator itself now lives in CodeMaster.Private/MiniApp (ignored wholesale above);
# only the template stays at the repo root, so it needs its own entry.
# These were previously untracked only by accident, which meant a single `git add -A`
# would have published the whole feature. Commit with `git add -f` if this ever becomes public.
/CodeMaster.MiniApp/

